  "sourceTitle": "Bar-B-Q Baked Beans",
  "sourceText": "Bar-B-Q Baked Beans\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 1:51pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound hamburger\n1/2 cup chopped onions\n1 can pork and beans\n1 can butter beans (drained)\n1 can kidney beans (drained)\n3/4 cup brown sugar\n1/2 cup catsup\n1 tablespoon dry mustard\n2 teaspoons vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Brown hamburger and onions, drain. Put all ingredients into a crock pot and simmer 2 hours.",
